WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.059
Writing the rule supplies the strategic

00:00:02.059 --> 00:00:04.480
context. Now, it is important to

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.520
note that how that rule is

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.460
actually executed, the specific database

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.300
queries, the AI rights, to go

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.580
fetch that data and test the

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.700
condition, is handled by the query

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.399
engines under the hood, which we

00:00:14.399 --> 00:00:15.359
need to discuss next.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.680
But the ontology is where the

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.880
rule is permanently documented, linked,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.540
and standardized for the whole company.
